#: src/views/swap_view.rs:267
msgid ""
"lz4 = fast (recommended), zstd = best ratio, lzo = legacy. Changing requires"
" zswap restart."
msgstr ""
"lz4 = snabb (rekommenderas), zstd = bäst kompressionsgrad, lzo = äldre "
"standard. Ändring kräver omstart av zswap."

